{"id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-finite-sequence-code.md","title":"可变长度自然数序列的可逆编码","display":"df-finite-sequence-code — 可变长度自然数序列的可逆编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","aliases":["20-df-finite-sequence-code"],"display":"df-finite-sequence-code — 可变长度自然数序列的可逆编码","chapter":"supplement","section":"notation","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Notation: Standard Pairing Function；可变长度序列的本地可逆编码","source_pdf_pages":[33],"source_printed_pages":["xxxii"],"depends_on":["[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-finite-sequence-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-finite-sequence-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-sequence-code — 可变长度自然数序列的可逆编码"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"notation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Notation: Standard Pairing Function；可变长度序列的本地可逆编码"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>33</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>xxxii</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\omega^k\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\omega^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,n\\in\\omega\">\\(x,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma^\\frown(x)\">\\(\\sigma^\\frown(x)\\)</span> 是在末端添加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1,\\pi_2\">\\(\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\)</span> 是配对的逆坐标。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite-sequence-code}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\epsilon):=0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\sigma^\\frown(x)):=1+\\langle\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\sigma),x\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{seqdecode}(0):=\\epsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{seqdecode}(n):=\\operatorname{seqdecode}(\\pi_1(n-1))^\\frown(\\pi_2(n-1))\\quad(n&gt;0).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite-sequence-code}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\epsilon):=0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\sigma^\\frown(x)):=1+\\langle\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\sigma),x\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{seqdecode}(0):=\\epsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{seqdecode}(n):=\\operatorname{seqdecode}(\\pi_1(n-1))^\\frown(\\pi_2(n-1))\\quad(n&gt;0).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>编码按序列长度递归，解码按自然数良序递归：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1(n-1)\\le n-1&lt;n\">\\(\\pi_1(n-1)\\le n-1&lt;n\\)</span>。两种递归均停止；对长度和代码分别归纳，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seqdecode}(\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\sigma))=\\sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{seqdecode}(\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\sigma))=\\sigma\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\operatorname{seqdecode}(n))=n\">\\(\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\operatorname{seqdecode}(n))=n\\)</span>。因此它们给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的有效双射。用有界的前值表可将解码实现为原始递归，长度、坐标与拼接也可有效计算。该编码不覆盖既有二进制串的 code 约定。</p>\n<p>来源：本书 Notation 的有限序列编码思想及标准配对；印刷 xxxii / PDF 33。显示式是供可变长度博弈历史与 Baire 树复用的本地编码，不声称是原书质数幂编码本身。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"x,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma^\\frown(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1,\\pi_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite-sequence-code}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\epsilon):=0,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\sigma^\\frown(x)):=1+\\langle\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\sigma),x\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{seqdecode}(0):=\\epsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{seqdecode}(n):=\\operatorname{seqdecode}(\\pi_1(n-1))^\\frown(\\pi_2(n-1))\\quad(n>0).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\pi_1(n-1)\\le n-1<n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{seqdecode}(\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\sigma))=\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{seqcode}(\\operatorname{seqdecode}(n))=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2057,"backlinks":[{"id":"2772d51949360c14","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"d88d5d86db02e1a1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-arith]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"e9155fcdafc74583","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-anal]]；see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-444","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-444","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]"}],"outgoing":["35073b74f84433b3","755e421576224435"]}